# Whitelist: send Docker only what the image needs. Everything else —
# storage/ (your uploads), .share.env (tunnel token), node_modules, venvs,
# git history — stays out of the build context.
*
!Dockerfile
!docker/
!web/
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/.env*
web/.agents
web/public/ort
# yt-dlp is fetched for the image's own OS/CPU during the build.
web/bin
web/.split-test
